Command purpose: inspect the Lanzou v0.2.5 landing page HTML after confirming HTTP 200.
Result: Python fetched the page successfully, but printing raw HTML failed because the Windows console GBK codec could not encode a page character (UnicodeEncodeError U+0371).
No project or production state was modified.
Resolution: extracted ASCII-safe status and structure instead; the supplied Lanzou URL remained HTTP 200.
